    "updated_at": "2024-08-28T13:15:59Z",
    "body": "> Are there tests covering this?\r\n\r\nThere is also wpt/html/canvas/element/manual/imagebitmap/createImageBitmap-colorSpaceConversion.html, which tests this with 2D canvas. It currently only does `HTMLImageElement` and `Blob`, but I'm updating it to include `ImageData`, `HTMLCanvasElement`, and `HTMLVideoElement`.",
